---
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import '../styles/app.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="What youple.tv is and how it works."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#181622"/><title>About — youple.tv</title><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://youple.tv/about"/></head>
<body>
  <main class="text-page">
    <p><a href="/">← youple.tv</a></p>
    <h1>About youple.tv</h1>
    <p>youple.tv lets you watch YouTube videos with friends, in sync, wherever everyone is. Make a room, send the link, and everyone sees the same moment at the same time.</p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>One click makes a room. No account needed.</li>
      <li>Anyone in the room can add videos, play, pause, seek and skip. Volume stays on your own device.</li>
      <li>Sponsor reads, self-promotion and subscribe reminders are skipped for the whole room at once. You can change what gets skipped, or turn it off, with the skip button under the player. Skip data comes from <a href="https://sponsor.ajay.app/">SponsorBlock</a>, shared under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>.</li>
      <li>Quick rooms close after 30 days without visitors. Sign in with Google, Discord or an email link to create permanent rooms, which keep the same link until you delete them.</li>
      <li>Whoever made a room is its host and can remove someone who is spoiling it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Free and ad-free</h2>
    <p>youple.tv is a small independent project. There are no ads and no tracking. Videos play through YouTube's own player, so YouTube's rules and ads apply inside it.</p>

    <h2>Say hi</h2>
    <p>Found a bug or have an idea? <a href="/contact?type=bug">Report a bug</a> or <a href="/contact">send us a message</a>.</p>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter/>
  <style>
    .text-page { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .text-page h1 { font-size: 40px; margin: 24px 0 12px; line-height: 1.15; }
    .text-page h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 32px 0 8px; }
    .text-page p, .text-page li { color: var(--muted); }
    .text-page a { color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
